1. $\operatorname{rad}(\mathfrak g)=Z(\mathfrak g)$;
2. $\mathfrak g=Z(\mathfrak g)\oplus[\mathfrak g,\mathfrak g]$ and the
   derived algebra is semisimple;
3. the adjoint representation of $\mathfrak g$ is completely reducible.

